00:40:45.997 --> 00:40:48.357
"and can only be bad for the Jews.

00:40:48.357 --> 00:40:49.457
"Discuss."

00:40:50.890 --> 00:40:54.197
Someone else writes, and you
can do with this what you want,

00:40:54.197 --> 00:40:55.770
"How did these Jewish scholars

00:40:55.770 --> 00:40:57.747
