00:46:29.520 --> 00:46:30.870
- Yeah.
- Well.

00:46:30.870 --> 00:46:32.000
So a more...

00:46:33.670 --> 00:46:34.900
I'll start with the 1970s.

00:46:34.900 --> 00:46:39.400
I mean, Yale, and I did not
